4281913.png","mimeType","image/png","size",544222,"sha256","96effce7a54b18259f3ac6a19a290f71d4f862b45801327c466bd60032c71808","width",1809,"height",1449,"url","createdAt","2026-10-20T17:32:39.727Z","variants",[195,200,204,208,212],{"_186":196,"_188":197,"_180":198,"_190":199},320,256,"image/webp","/igenu-preview/media/f7db19bc9da969b069506228.webp",{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_180":198,"_190":203},640,513,"/igenu-preview/media/9e26d52402655e540b305fd0.webp",{"_186":205,"_188":206,"_180":198,"_190":207},960,769,"/igenu-preview/media/1e64887f2c4083e3b4c84b69.webp",{"_186":209,"_188":210,"_180":198,"_190":211},1280,1025,"/igenu-preview/media/a853495b9ddf518f0be39552.webp",{"_186":213,"_188":214,"_180":198,"_190":215},1600,1282,"/igenu-preview/media/f0f509b5abc23cc9078dfaf4.webp","detailLayout","STRUCTURED","availableLocales",[19,20,11],"bodyHtml","<strong><span>Product features:</span></strong><br />◆ Split type, suitable for different on-site installation requirements<br />◆ Automatic adjustment of transmission power based on flow rate, advanced digital model calculation, anti-interference design<br />◆ Easy to use, reliable results, interface operation instructions can reduce operational errors<br />◆ The probe material is available in POM, PVDF, and PTFE, suitable for various working conditions<br />◆ Internally integrated temperature sensor, capable of real-time temperature compensation for sound velocity<br /><br /><strong><span>Technical parameters:</span></strong><br />Liquid level height: ≤ 5m<br />Instantaneous flow rate: determined by the type and specifications of the measuring weir tank used<br />Accumulated traffic: 0-99999999999m ³<br />Resolution: 0.001m ³/h<br />Accuracy: 2%<br />Blind spot: 0.3m<br />Display mode: LCD display<br />Launch angle: 6 °~10 °<br />Protection level: Protection level: Transmitter: IP65； Transmitter: IP68<br />Power Supply: DC18-36V； AC90-260V<br />Signal: 4-20mA, RS485 (optional)<br />Alarm: Multi way relay<br />\n    ","gallery",